  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Erdős Problem 188",
  "excerpt": "This Lean 4 project proves new bounds for [Erdős Problem 188](https://www.erdosproblems.com/188), as cataloged by Thomas F. Bloom. Let `K*` be the least `k` for which the plane can be colored red and blue with no two red points at distance one and no `k` blue points `z, z + d, …, z + (k - 1)d` with `|d| = 1`."
 },
